------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

trica runs alongside, but does not embed:

  PostgreSQL          PostgreSQL   database (container image or external)

Go dependencies are declared in go.mod and go.sum, JavaScript dependencies in
web/pnpm-lock.yaml, and an SBOM ships with every release image.

The device-type library (internal/devicetypes/library/) is part of this project.
Where the rest of the library came from is recorded in docs/adr/0063. CC0-1.0
attaches no condition to it.

The device face drawings in internal/devicetypes/library/drawings/, and the PNG
files generated from them in internal/devicetypes/library/elevation-images/
(same name), are original works of this project, drawn from vendors' published
facts (no vendor picture or stencil was used), and are dedicated to the public
domain under CC0-1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). The
list and the sources are in internal/devicetypes/library/README.md.

The colour tokens of the web UI (web/src/styles/tokens.css) are steps of:

  Radix Colors   Copyright (c) 2022 WorkOS   MIT licence
    https://github.com/radix-ui/colors

The palette of the built-in "flat" theme (internal/theme/builtin/flat/theme.json) takes its
colour values from the Diametral Design System, MIT licence. No logo, name or font file of it is
included.
